    description: "FIXED 2026-09-02, found while building a player's own Chaos Space Marines army list (giving a Possessed unit Jump packs to represent wings — the cost came out far higher than expected). Possessed's own option group (\"All model may be equipped with Jump packs for +11 points per model\") is `constraint: 'every'` with a named choice, where the quantity picked already means \"how many models have this\" — the same mechanism Grey Knights' Nemesis-force-weapon swap and dozens of other 'any model can swap...' options across the game already use correctly with NO extra flag. This one, plus 4 siblings, also carried a `per_model: true` flag on the group — a leftover from a DIFFERENT, simpler shape (a single flat toggle for the whole unit with no named choice, like Psy-ammunition), where that flag is required. Combined with a real per-choice quantity, it multiplied the total by the unit's full size a SECOND time: 5 Possessed with Jump packs (11pts/model) computed as 11 × 5 (models with it) × 5 (unit size) = 275pts instead of 55. Found and fixed the same shape on 4 more datasheets across 2 other factions: Chaos Space Marines' Big Mutants (\"Any model may be equipped with\" Machine gun), Necrons' Tomb Blades (\"The unit can swap its Twin tesla carbines\"), and Tau Empire's Hazard Battlesuits (\"Any model may swap each Pulse submunition rifle\") and Broadside Battlesuits (both its \"Any model can swap/equip...\" groups) — removed the redundant `per_model` flag from all 5. Also audited the whole `data/parsed` tree for every other `per_model: true` occurrence (~15 more) to be sure nothing else had the same shape — all were either the safe empty-choices/`inline_pts` pattern (Death Company/Reiver Marines/Wolf Scout/Scout Squad jump packs and camo cloaks, Horus Heresy's \"They Shall Know No Fear\") or already correctly typed `constraint:'one'` (Honor Guard, Ork Skarboyz, Tyranid Special Biomorphs) — see ki-ig-unit-may-get-one-ability-double-pick-01 for the one related bug this audit DID turn up. Verified live: a 5-model Possessed unit with all 5 given Jump packs now costs +55pts, not +275.",
