    description: "FIXED 2026-08-26, reported on Discord/chat (Rigzar: \"no puedo elegir el mismo item para cada miembro... en los Chosen\"). CAUSE: this is a deeper root cause behind the same symptom class as ki-armory-weapon-purchase-count-non-champion-01 above — that fix added an armory-purchase-count branch inside `computeWeaponGroups`'s per-weapon override loop, but the loop itself is skipped entirely per group when `grp.count == null && !unitHasMultiCopyWeapon && !hasAnyOptionSelection` (an early `continue`, written before Armory purchases were a case this loop needed to handle at all). `hasAnyOptionSelection` only looks at `item.optionQty` (squad-level swap/grant option groups) — it says nothing about `item.armory`. A unit like Chaos Space Marines' Chosen, bought via the Armory alone with no squad option group touched, has `optionQty` empty and an unlabelled single group with `count: null`, so the ENTIRE loop — including the fix above — never ran, and the weapon rendered via its default fallback with no count prefix at all, regardless of how many were bought. Live-reproduced: a 3-model Chosen buying \"Boltgun\" twice from the Armory showed a bare \"Boltgun\" row (not \"1x\", not \"2x\") while the Armory panel and points total (105→110→115) tracked the purchases correctly the whole time — the bug was purely in the Live Profile's weapon-table rendering path. FIX: added `hasArmoryGrantedWeapon = grp.weapons.some(w => grantedSet.has(w.name) && !datasheetNames.has(w.name))` and included it in the skip condition, so a group containing an Armory-only weapon always runs the loop regardless of squad-option state. This is a general engine fix, not per-unit — it covers every unit hitting the same pattern (any squad or Champion/leader row buying Armory items with no other option group selected), not just Chosen. Verified live: Chosen 3x, buy Boltgun ×2 → \"2x Boltgun\", 115pts. Also verified the loop still separates a Champion/leader's own purchases correctly from the rest of the squad: Grey Knights Paladin Squad's Paragon (built-in leader with its own Armory access) buying Psyk-out grenades ×2 shows \"2x Psyk-out grenades\" on the Paragon's own row only — the 4 ordinary Paladins' row is untouched.",
