    description: 'FIXED 2026-08-13, found while investigating GH#89. Production wrote the squad\'s loadout as "Every Neophyte: Astartes chainsword; …" — a colon shorthand — where the sheet and the engine both use "Every Neophyte IS EQUIPPED WITH: …". None of the three clauses parsed, so the unit rendered as one merged block: no separate Neophyte / Initiate / Sword Brother rows, no per-model attribution, and an Initiate\'s swapped weapon counted once per Initiate. Rewritten in the canonical form, and the three Initiate/Neophyte option groups gained `applies_to_model` since both models carry an Astartes chainsword and a swap has to say whose. Swept every unit for the same signature — a loadout naming two or more model groups that the clause matcher cannot read — and found three others, all of which are FINE: the Inquisition Henchman Warband\'s compact summary (its sheet has no loadout line at all, and its specialists already print correct quantities), and Kroot Carnivores plus Ghostkeel Battlesuits, whose text matches their sheets verbatim.',
