    description: 'FIXED 2026-08-13, GitHub #84: "1 Blue horror and 1 brimstone horror is included in the pink horror unit and 1 brimstone horror is included in the blue unit with no way to remove them… there should be none until they split, which occurs during the battle, not during army construction." The reporter is right, and the canon says so plainly: on both sheets those rows carry "-" in the No. column and no price, which is the datasheet convention for a reference statline you need once the unit splits mid-game, not a model you buy. The import had turned them into ordinary models with min 1 / max 1 at 0 points, so every Pink Horror squad started with a Blue and a Brimstone welded in and `default_size` counted them (11 instead of 9). Moved to `variant_models`, where the profile is still recorded but is not a squad member; `default_size` and `min_cost` recomputed (Pink Horrors 9 models / 342 pts, Blue Horrors 9 / 189). Swept every unit in the game for the same signature — a 0-point model the player cannot remove — and these three rows were the only ones: the Tau battlesuits\' free drones and the Necron Dynasty Phaeron\'s Triarchal Mehirs are counted "2" on their sheets, not "-", and are genuinely included.',
